[# checklist.j2 — bottom-of-PR reviewer checklist.
   4/7 surveyed PRs ended with a checklist of validation tasks.

   Variables expected in scope:
     checklist_items: array of {label: string, checked: bool}

   GitHub renders `- [x]` and `- [ ]` as interactive checkboxes.
   IMPORTANT: spaces INSIDE the brackets break the checkbox; use `[x]` and `[ ]` exactly.
   The if/else block below emits literal brackets to dodge the [[[ ... ]]] lexer trap.
#]

## Checklist

[% for item in checklist_items -%]
- [% if item.checked %][x][% else %][ ][% endif %] [[ item.label ]]
[% endfor -%]
